<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="cbfc-2c9f-669b-511a" name="The Cursed Cavalcade (1c) - Local Pilot Draft" revision="4" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="9481a749-7900-614b-1695-bdc2899069c1" gameSystemRevision="16" type="catalogue">
  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry id="531d-9497-c4c6-5b3d" name="Sun King Mask" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="3e67-bcea-b93c-565e" type="max" field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="6699-e93c-6354-56dd" name="Sun King Mask" hidden="false">
          <description>Free when assigned to a hero during warband creation. After creation, the price is 70 GC. The same mask may be assigned only once per warband. This uniqueness is documented here; New Recruit enforcement is not verified.

The warrior Wearing the Sun King Mask cannot be Knocked Down or Stunned, nor by effects or due to a result on the Injury Table.

Availability: Aristocrat only.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" gc" typeId="points" value="0" />
        <cost name=" Warband Rating" typeId="wb-rating" value="0" />
        <cost name="Rarity" typeId="rarity" value="0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="71e3-ca5b-68f5-5ba7" name="Silver Death Mask" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="482e-0f36-36db-557b" type="max" field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="c36f-2890-fa24-53d0" name="Silver Death Mask" hidden="false">
          <description>Free when assigned to a hero during warband creation. After creation, the price is 50 GC. The same mask may be assigned only once per warband. This uniqueness is documented here; New Recruit enforcement is not verified.

If the Hero wearing the Silver Mask is taken Out of Action, he may reroll any result on a Serious Injury chart. He must accept the second result even if it is worse than the previous roll.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" gc" typeId="points" value="0" />
        <cost name=" Warband Rating" typeId="wb-rating" value="0" />
        <cost name="Rarity" typeId="rarity" value="0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="2d06-cb8e-220b-5c6c" name="Fish Head Mask" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="970d-f28f-9019-54fa" type="max" field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="caff-7c22-329d-51df" name="Fish Head Mask" hidden="false">
          <description>Free when assigned to a hero during warband creation. After creation, the price is 60 GC. The same mask may be assigned only once per warband. This uniqueness is documented here; New Recruit enforcement is not verified.

Every time the wearer of the Fish Head Mask takes an opponent Out of Action he gains a wound back (if he lost any) or gain an additional wound up to a maximum of 5. This additional wound lasts until the end of the battle.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" gc" typeId="points" value="0" />
        <cost name=" Warband Rating" typeId="wb-rating" value="0" />
        <cost name="Rarity" typeId="rarity" value="0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="9d1a-5abb-676a-57d5" name="Faceless Mask" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="1274-444e-27b5-53d9" type="max" field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="ecb5-0028-0f66-504b" name="Faceless Mask" hidden="false">
          <description>Free when assigned to a hero during warband creation. After creation, the price is 30 GC. The same mask may be assigned only once per warband. This uniqueness is documented here; New Recruit enforcement is not verified.

The warrior wearing the Faceless Mask may stop one model from Intercepting his charge once per game. Models immune to psychology such as Undead and Flagellants are unaffected by this.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" gc" typeId="points" value="0" />
        <cost name=" Warband Rating" typeId="wb-rating" value="0" />
        <cost name="Rarity" typeId="rarity" value="0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="5e76-625e-99a7-53d3" name="Plague Doctor Mask" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="16e1-c0d1-9887-5d68" type="max" field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="c031-0e13-caa9-557a" name="Plague Doctor Mask" hidden="false">
          <description>Free when assigned to a hero during warband creation. After creation, the price is 45 GC. The same mask may be assigned only once per warband. This uniqueness is documented here; New Recruit enforcement is not verified.

Once per game, in the shooting phase, the wearer may unleash the black cloud from within the mask, burning those not part of the Cavalcade. The longer the power is held within the mask, the more potent its effect will be. On the first turn it hits any enemy model within 3" of the wearer at Strength 1, and the distance and the Strength of the effect increases by 1 in the beginning of each turn of the Cavalcade, up to range of 7" and Strength 5. Roll to hit (with no penalties for range or cover) and to wound as usual. This effect cannot cause critical hits.

Availability: Twisted Scholar only.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" gc" typeId="points" value="0" />
        <cost name=" Warband Rating" typeId="wb-rating" value="0" />
        <cost name="Rarity" typeId="rarity" value="0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="5300-ad2c-8a0a-5868" name="Evil Jester Mask" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="1fb7-a98d-7a83-523a" type="max" field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="7f69-d027-2ee2-5e80" name="Evil Jester Mask" hidden="false">
          <description>Free when assigned to a hero during warband creation. After creation, the price is 70 GC. The same mask may be assigned only once per warband. This uniqueness is documented here; New Recruit enforcement is not verified.

At the beginning of the battle roll a D6: on a roll of 1 the warrior is subject to Stupidity for the duration of the battle. On a roll of 2-5, the warrior hates all the enemies during the battle. On a roll of 6, the warrior is affected by Frenzy.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" gc" typeId="points" value="0" />
        <cost name=" Warband Rating" typeId="wb-rating" value="0" />
        <cost name="Rarity" typeId="rarity" value="0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
  </sharedSelectionEntries>
  <selectionEntries>
